    "title": "LandGlide",
    "description": "LandGlide\u00ae is the most advanced and comprehensive parcel data and property line map application. Using GPS to pinpoint your location, access key parcel data anywhere.\r\n\r\n- Hover over a property to instantly view details.\r\n- Search for properties by owner, address, or parcel numbers.\r\n- Save your favorites, add notes, and export.\r\n- Access LandGlide on all of your devices.\r\n\r\nAccess over 156 million parcel records in over 3,000 counties  covering more than 99% of the U.S. population. With LandGlide, you\u2019ll have online and offline access to parcel data including:\r\n\r\n- Property Owner\r\n- Acreage\r\n- Square Footage\r\n- Property Address\r\n- Transfer Date\r\n- School District\r\n- Sale Price\r\n- Building Description\r\n- and More!\r\n\r\nGet Started with a free trial. Free for your first seven days. $9.99 / month or $99.99 / year thereafter.\r\n\r\nView our terms of service at https://reportallusa.com/solutions/landglide/terms_of_service.html",
